window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>In 1945 New Orleans, vampire Finn Ovesen returns after years away and is drawn to a smoky jazz club by the haunting sound of a piano-and the fragile heartbeat of the woman playing it. Selena, a talented pianist with a terminal illness, lives each night like it's her last, hiding her pain behind music and wit. When Finn offers her a coat on a cool evening, it sparks a dangerous attraction neither of them expects. But as their connection deepens, secrets unravel-his immortality, her mortality-and they must decide if one unforgettable night can change the course of two very different eternities.</p>"; 
